# ─── Token files at repo root ─────────────────────────────────
# These sat untracked-but-unignored and would be swept up by
# `git add -A`. They hold live Shopify Admin / Oxygen credentials.
# Verified 2026-09-01: none of these are in git history.
admin-token.json
deploy-token.json
*-token.json
*.token
oxygen-token*.bak
.codex-auth/

# ─── Local scratch at repo root ──────────────────────────────
# One-shot patches and ship scripts from earlier sessions. Kept on disk as
# history, never source control.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignored, so they stay visible in `git status`:
# ship-all.ps1 and ship-watch-cohort.ps1 are superseded and assume an older
# HEAD - they must not be re-run, and hiding them would make that easier to
# forget, not harder.
puchica-four.patch
reflow320.patch
fix-404.patch
ci-green.patch
puchica-all-three.patch
puchica-ci-fix.patch
